    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hello, I am struggling to understand the meaning of the phrase \"Pairs get automatically registered to be recognized by <BS> and <CR>\" in the description of mini.pairs.\r\n\r\nI live in a non-English-speaking country. Could you please provide additional explanation about what kind of actions this refers to?\r\n\r\nThank you very much for creating such a great plugin.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hello, I am struggling to understand the meaning of the phrase \"Pairs get automatically registered to be recognized by  and \" in the description of mini.pairs.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I live in a non-English-speaking country. Could you please provide additional explanation about what kind of actions this refers to?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thank you very much for creating such a great plugin.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hello, I am struggling to understand the meaning of the phrase \"Pairs get automatically registered to be recognized by  and \" in the description of mini.pairs.\nI live in a non-English-speaking country. Could you please provide additional explanation about what kind of actions this refers to?\nThank you very much for creating such a great plugin.",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
        "emoji": ":pray:",
        "emojiHTML": "<div>🙏</div>",
        "id": "DIC_kwDOFoksYM4CAgqN",
        "isAnswerable": true,
        "name": "Q&A",
